---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Pantaloni scurti barbati | Casual, bumbac, negri';
const description = 'Pantaloni scurti barbati pentru vara: modele casual, negre, bumbac, sport si cargo. Ghid rapid de alegere si tinute.';
const canonical = 'https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-scurti/';
const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'CollectionPage',
  name: title,
  description,
  url: canonical,
};

const cards = [
  ['Pantaloni scurti barbati negri', 'Cea mai simpla alegere pentru tricouri albe, gri sau oversized.'],
  ['Pantaloni scurti barbati bumbac', 'Potriviti pentru vara, drumuri scurte si tinute lejere de weekend.'],
  ['Pantaloni scurti casual barbati', 'Pentru oras, vacanta si outfituri relaxate fara aspect sportiv excesiv.'],
  ['Pantaloni scurti cargo', 'Croiala utilitara, buzunare si look streetwear.'],
  ['Pantaloni scurti sport barbati', 'Alege-i cand vrei libertate de miscare si material usor.'],
  ['Pantaloni trei sferturi barbati', 'Intentie apropiata, utila pentru comparatii si ghiduri de lungime.'],
];
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} schema={schema}>
  <section class="bg-white border-b border-ink/10">
    <div class="section grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">pantaloni scurti barbati</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black leading-tight md:text-6xl">Pantaloni scurti barbati pentru vara si tinute casual</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">Pagina dedicata pentru cautarile sezoniere: pantaloni scurti barbati, pantaloni scurti bumbac barbati, modele negre, casual, sport si cargo.</p>
        <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact">Intreaba despre stoc</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="/pantaloni-lungi">Pantaloni cu snur barbati</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-mist">
        <img src="/og-pantaloni-cu-snur-lung.jpg" alt="pantaloni scurti barbati casual pentru vara" title="Pantaloni scurti barbati" width="1200" height="630" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="aspect-[1200/630] w-full object-cover" />
        <figcaption class="px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/65">Modele scurte pentru vara, vacanta si tinute casual.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="mb-8 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">intentii seo</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Tipuri de pantaloni scurti barbati cautate</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-ink/70">Exporturile arata ca termenul principal are volum mare sezonier, iar variantele cu bumbac, negri, cargo si sport pot sustine pagina prin subsectiuni clare.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {cards.map(([name, text]) => (
        <article class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">{name}</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-ink/70">{text}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ink text-white">
    <div class="section grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr]">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Cum alegi pantalonii scurti</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-white/75">
        <p class="leading-8">Pentru vara, verifica materialul, lungimea si talia. Bumbacul este placut in tinute casual, iar croielile cu talie reglabila sunt utile cand vrei confort. Pentru oras, modelele negre sau bej sunt mai usor de asortat decat culorile foarte puternice.</p>
        <p class="leading-8">Daca vrei un look streetwear, poti alege pantaloni scurti cargo sau croieli mai largi. Daca vrei o tinuta curata, combina pantaloni scurti barbati cu tricou simplu si sneakers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="lg:col-span-2">
        <p class="eyebrow">linking intern</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black">Legatura cu pantalonii lungi si blogul</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-ink/70">Pagina de pantaloni scurti trebuie sa trimita natural spre pantaloni cu snur barbati pentru utilizatorii care cauta modele lungi, dar si spre articole despre bumbac, poliester, croieli si marimi. Astfel, site-ul construieste autoritate pe intreg clusterul pantaloni barbati.</p>
      </article>
      <aside class="rounded-md border border-ink/10 bg-white p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Citeste si</h2>
        <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm font-semibold">
          <a href="/pantaloni-lungi">Pantaloni cu snur barbati</a>
          <a href="/blog/051-ce-este-bumbacul">Ce este bumbacul</a>
          <a href="/blog/061-ce-este-poliesterul">Ce este poliesterul</a>
          <a href="/blog/519-ce-inseamna-bermude">Ce inseamna bermude</a>
        </nav>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
